<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan auctions six-month bonds in OMO.</title>
<headline>Pakistan auctions six-month bonds in OMO.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State (central) Bank of Pakistan said it had auctioned six-month maturity short-term federal bonds worth a total of 1.4 billion rupees in its weekly open market operation on Wednesday.</p>
<p>			 Offered	  Accepted	  Max. cut-off</p>
<p>Outright sale 1,400 400 16.50 pct one-month 30 nil nil Three-month 20 nil nil Five-month 1,320 1,000 16.50 pct Total (million rupees) 2,770 1,400</p>
<p>($1 = 40.49 rupees) -- Ovais Subhani 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
